'''Snowflake''' is an [[Uncommon Weapons|uncommon]] knife that was obtainable by purchasing the 13th tier in the Battle Pass during the [[Christmas Event 2022|2022 Christmas Event]].  It is now only obtainable through trading as the event has since ended.

== Appearance ==
The knife uses the default knife mesh and has a dark turquoise blade. There are white snowflake patterns on the blade, above a light blue guard. The handle is black in color. 

==Trivia==
*It has a [[Snowflake (Gun)|partner gun]] under the same name.
*It was designed by [[IDontHaveAUse]].

